# 9. ORDER AND INVENTORY LOGIC

Implement reliable order processing.

When an order is placed:

1. Validate customer details.
2. Validate product availability.
3. Validate selected product variants.
4. Recalculate all prices on the server.
5. Validate discount codes.
6. Calculate order subtotal.
7. Apply valid discounts.
8. Record delivery charges.
9. Calculate total payable.
10. Create the order and order items transactionally.
11. Record the selected payment method.
12. Update inventory safely according to the defined reservation and confirmation policy.
13. Send order confirmation.
14. Make the order visible in the Admin Dashboard.

Prevent:
- Duplicate orders.
- Duplicate payment records.
- Overselling.
- Client-side price manipulation.
- Invalid coupons.
- Unauthorized order access.

Use appropriate inventory reservation expiry for unpaid online orders.

