# 19. FINAL PROJECT OBJECTIVE

The finished DIAMOND STORE must operate as a unified online fashion business.

A customer should be able to visit the website, browse products, select sizes and colours, add items to the cart, place an order, make payment, and track delivery.

The Super Admin should be able to manage products, categories, prices, stock, customers, orders, payments, deliveries, promotions, website content, reports and staff from one secure dashboard.

When the administrator adds a new product, it should automatically become available on the public website when published.

When a customer places an order, it should automatically appear in the Admin Dashboard.

When payment is verified, the payment and order records must update correctly.

When the administrator changes website content, the public website must reflect those changes.

The customer website and Admin Dashboard must remain synchronized through the same production database.

**Build DIAMOND STORE as a professional, secure, scalable and maintainable e-commerce platform that can support a real business in Nigeria and serve international customers.**

Begin by establishing the project architecture, database schema, authentication system and design foundation. Then implement and test each module systematically.

Do not stop after generating the homepage. The complete application is the objective.